#. Description of the plugin
#: sm-buildings.php
msgid "Steel buildings market: new and used warehouses, agricultural and industrial hangars, workshops, livestock buildings and building kits, assembled or dismantled. Adds the \"buildings\" market to the SM Products listing engine: dimensions and area, structural system, roof and cladding, what the price includes, structural element inventory weighed by SM Weight Engine, price per kg and per m², indicative drawing. Requires SM Core, SM Weight Engine and SM Products 0.3.0."
msgstr ""

